e moyenne."]],[69890,"otitique","adjective",0,"","","",[["otitic","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"otitique","masculine_plural":"otitiques"},[],["Enfin, le problème du diagnostic reste souvent difficile entre une méningite tuberculeuse et des phénomènes méningés d'origine otitique."]],[69891,"oto-rhino-laryngologie","noun",0,"/ɔ.to.ʁi.no.la.ʁɛ̃.ɡɔ.lɔ.ʒi/","f",[46975,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-oto-rhino-laryngologie.wav.mp3"],[["otorhinolaryngology","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"oto-rhino-laryngologies"},[],""],[69892,"otoconie","noun",0,"","f","",[["otoconium","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"otoconies"},[],""],[69893,"otocyon","noun",0,"/ɔ.tɔ.sjɔ̃/","m",[46976,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-otocyon.wav.mp3"],[["bat-eared fox","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"otocyons"},[],["L'otocyon a aussi de très grandes oreilles.","Grâce à leurs grandes oreilles, les otocyons possèdent une ouïe excellente leur permettant de détecter facilement leur nourriture dans le sol."]],[69894,"otocyste","noun",0,"/ɔ.tɔ.sist/","m",[46977,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Bananax47-otocyste.wav.mp3"],[["otocyst","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"otocystes"},[],["Quelques schizopodes seulement en sont pourvus et c'est seulement chez les décapodes que l'otocyste se retrouve toujours."]],[69895,"otographie","noun",0,"","f","",[["otography","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"otographies"},[],""],[69896,"otographique","adjective",0,"","","",[["otographic","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"otographique","masculine_plural":"otographiques"},[],""],[69897,"otolithe","noun",0,"/ɔ.tɔ.lit/","m",[46978,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Bananax47-otolithe.wav.mp3"],[["otolith","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"otolithes"},[],["Une(sic) superbe otolithe pêchée en verticale dans la mangrove de la Casamance au sud du Sénégal."]],[69898,"otolithique","adjective",0,"","","",[["otolithic","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"otolithique","masculine_plural":"otolithiques"},[],""],[69899,"otologie","noun",0,"/ɔ.tɔ.lɔ.ʒi/","f",[46979,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-otologi